.740" end="00:41.160">to </span><span begin="00:41.160" end="00:41.370">the </span><span begin="00:41.370" end="00:42.030">gate</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.030" end="00:46.290"><span begin="00:42.030" end="00:42.480">And </span><span begin="00:42.480" end="00:42.810">bid </span><span begin="00:42.810" end="00:46.290">farewell</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.020" end="00:51.090"><span begin="00:49.020" end="00:49.860">Summer </span><span begin="00:49.860" end="00:50.070">in </span><span begin="00:50.070" end="00:51.090">Sevilla</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.140" end="00:57.540"><span begin="00:52.140" end="00:52.830">Drinking </span><span begin="00:52.830" end="00:53.040">red </span><span begin="00:53.040" end="00:54.450">sangria </span><span begin="00:54.450" end="00:54.870">by </span><span begin="00:54.870" end="00:55.110">the </span><span begin="00:55.110" end="00:55.860">fountain </span><span begin="00:55.860" end="00:56.040">in </span><span begin="00:56.040" end="00:56.130">the </span><span begin="00:56.130" end="00:57.540">square</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.110" end="01:01.140"><span begin="00:58.110" end="00:58.800">Imagine </span><span begin="00:58.800" end="00:59.040">that </span><span begin="00:59.040" end="00:59.280">you're </span><span begin="00:59.280" end="01:00.480">seated </span><span begin="01:00.480" end="01:00.750">with </span><span begin="01:00.750" end="01:01.140">me</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.170" end="01:03.240"><span begin="01:01.170" end="01:01.500">That </span><span begin="01:01.500" end="01:01.650">we're </span><span begin="01:01.650" end="01:02.280">flying </span><span begin="01:02.280" end="01:03.240">there</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.170" end="01:20.310"><span begin="01:04.170" end="01:04.560">But </span><span begin="01:04.560" end="01:04.710">you're </span><span begin="01:04.710" end="01:04.950">way </span><span begin="01:04.950" end="01:05.280">back </span><span b