:43.140">On </span><span begin="01:43.140" end="01:43.380">this </span><span begin="01:43.380" end="01:44.400">airplane </span><span begin="01:44.400" end="01:44.430">（</span><span begin="01:44.430" end="01:47.970">oh</span><span begin="01:47.970" end="01:48.480">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.480" end="01:51.720"><span begin="01:48.480" end="01:48.900">There's </span><span begin="01:48.900" end="01:49.140">no </span><span begin="01:49.140" end="01:49.500">need </span><span begin="01:49.500" end="01:49.830">for </span><span begin="01:49.830" end="01:51.720">entertainment</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.170" end="01:54.480"><span begin="01:52.170" end="01:52.710">TV </span><span begin="01:52.710" end="01:53.130">screens </span><span begin="01:53.130" end="01:53.310">be </span><span begin="01:53.310" end="01:54.480">beaming</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.510" end="01:57.900"><span begin="01:54.510" end="01:54.900">But </span><span begin="01:54.900" end="01:55.200">you're </span><span begin="01:55.200" end="01:55.530">my </span><span begin="01:55.530" end="01:57.900">preoccupation</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.260" end="02:00.510"><span begin="01:58.260" end="01:58.650">Kill </span><span begin="01:58.650" end="01:58.800">the </span><span begin="01:58.800" end="01:59.460">13 </span><span begin="01:59.460" end="02:00.510">hours</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.510" end="02:03.540"><span begin="02:00.510" end="02:01.560">Rummaging </span><span begin="02:01.560" end="02:01.860">through </span><span begin="02:01.860" end="02:02.220">every </span><span begin="02:02.220" end="02:03.000">brain </span><span begin="02:03.000" end="02:03.540">cell</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.200" end="02:10.290"><span begin="02:04.200" end="02:05.130">Memories </span><span begin="02:05.130" end="02:06.570">replaying </span><span begin="02:06.570" end="02:06.900">in </span><span begin="02:06.900" end="02:07.200">my </span><span begin="